This n8n workflow automates a **jobs newsletter system** by collecting job opportunities, formatting them into a clean newsletter, and sending them to subscribers automatically. It typically works by
triggering on a schedule (daily/weekly), then pulling job listings from one or multiple sources (like APIs, websites, Google Sheets, Airtable, or Notion). After collecting the job data, the workflow
cleans and organizes it, removes duplicates, and uses an AI or formatting step to turn the raw listings into a readable email-style newsletter with proper sections, titles, and links. Finally, it sends
the newsletter through an email service (like Gmail, SendGrid, Mailchimp, etc.) to your mailing list, making the whole process fully automated without manual writing or copying. 
